cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PriceHub in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PriceHub: Unified Python Package for Collecting OHLC Prices from Cryptocurrency Exchange APIs"
abstract: >-
  PriceHub is a Python package providing a unified interface for retrieving
  OHLC (Open, High, Low, Close) market data from multiple cryptocurrency
  exchanges including Binance, Bybit, Coinbase, OKX, Kraken, KuCoin, and
  Bitget (spot and futures markets where applicable). It normalizes
  exchange-specific APIs, supports flexible timestamp inputs, custom
  intervals, and returns data as pandas DataFrames suitable for
  quantitative analysis, backtesting, and academic research.
